  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\WelcomePageLink\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\WelcomePageHeader\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir fàilte air Windows Hello
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\WelcomePageBody\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dh’fhàs an t-uidheam agad nas pearsanta. Soraidh slàn le faclan-faire toinnte agus cuir fàilte air Windows Hello gus a’ ghlais a thoirt far an uidheim agad, dearbhadh cò thusa agus rudan a cheannach san Store slighe do shùilean.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\WelcomePageBeta\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: BETA
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\TutorialPageInstruction\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cum am fòn agad air beulaibh do shùilean is an uairsin tagh “Air adhart” gus leantainn air adhart.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\PinRequiredPageBody\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cruthaich PIN ma thachras nach bi aithnicheadh lorg do shùla ri làimh. Dh’fhaoidte nach bi feum agad air idir, ach bidh e na lethbhreac-glèidhidh dhut co-dhiù.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\PinRequiredPageBodyTwo\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Turas a shuidhich thu PIN, ’s urrainn dhut clàradh a-steach le do shùilean.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\OrientationErrorPageHeader\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gleus comhair na sgrìn
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\ErrorPageInstruction\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dùin Windows Hello is feuch an suidheachadh a-rithist an uairsin.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\ErrorPageHeader\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha sinn duilich ach chaidh rudeigin cearr.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\CompletePageRepeatInstruction\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gliocas: Nan robh speuclairean ort nuair an shuidhich thu Windows Hello, tagh “Pisich an t-aithneachadh” gus a shuidheachadh a-rithist às an aonais. Cuidichidh seo ach an aithnich sinn thu le speuclairean ann no às.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\CompletePageHeader\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Sin thu deiseil!
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Iris\CompletePageBody\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gabhaidh a’ ghlais a thoirt far an uidheim agad slighe do shùilean an ath-thuras.
