    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Thoir tionndaidh dhen uidheam agad ach am bi an camara air uachdar.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\IrisEnrollProgressText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ag ionnsachadh dè an coltas a tha ort…
  \BioEnrollmentUI\IrisCaptureBodyTextMobile:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cum am fòn dìreach air beulaibh do shùilean is dèan cinnteach gum faic thu an dà shùil agad air an sgrìn.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\IrisCaptureBodyTextDesktop:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gluais nas dlùithe gu slaodach gus am bean do shùilean ri oir an fhrèama.
