  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\ErrorPageInstruction\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dùin Windows Hello is feuch an suidheachadh a-rithist an uairsin.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\ErrorPageInstructionDuplicateTemplate\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Shuidhich thu Windows Hello air cunntas eile mu thràth a-rèir coltais. Thoir aithneachadh aodainnean air falbh on chunntas eile ’s feuch ris a-rithist an uairsin.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\ErrorPageInstructionCameraAccessConflict\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha an camara ga chleachdadh le aplacaid eile an-dràsta. Dùin an aplacaid is feuch ris a-rithist.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\ErrorPageInstructionBadOrMissingHardware\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cha b' urrainn dhuinn an camara a chur air. Dèan cinnteach gu bheil e ag obair mar bu chòir.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\ErrorPageHeader\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha sinn duilich ach chaidh rudeigin cearr.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\CompletePageRepeatInstruction\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gliocas: Ma bha speuclairean ort nuair an shuidhich thu aithnicheadh aodainnean, tagh “Pisich an t-aithneachadh” gus a shuidheachadh a-rithist às an aonais. Cuidichidh seo sinn ach an aithnich sinn thu le speuclairean ann no às.
  \BioEnrollmentUI\Face\CompletePageHeader\Text:
